GS","source":"The Edge Malaysia","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFAyU3hUbnpfejNlT3BzZXZiVEtpTkhkVllPZ2JqMUx0c3J3YVhHeUdDaHhFaXQ5enhmTHpaZzB5WThzMWFQSk1nb2xoVTdKWnVC?oc=5","date":"2026-11-10"}],"events":[{"date":"2026-12-31","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (10 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Oct (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"Yinson has seen a slew of announcements and news around a takeover/privatisation offer, including TAKE-OVERS & MERGERS disclosures and changes in substantial shareholders' interests (EPF, KWAP). News indicates MISC plans to acquire and privatise Yinson for about RM7.31bil, with the offer described as 'fair and reasonable'; the company says it has yet to decide, while a politician urged caution. Latest quarter (2026-07-31) revenue fell 16.7% yoy while net profit rose 26.7% yoy.","notable_en":["MISC proposed a takeover and privatisation of Yinson for about RM7.31bil.","Yinson said it has yet to decide on the RM4bil privatisation offer.","The offer was described as 'fair and reasonable' by the independent adviser, which urged shareholders to accept."],"risks_en":["A politician called for extra caution over the proposed Yinson takeover.","News reported MISC shareholders' displeasure at the Yinson deal.","Analysts noted the acquisition exposes MISC shareholders to higher risks."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 2026-07-31, revenue was MYR1.136bil, down 16.7% yoy but up 8.3% qoq; net profit was MYR128mil, up 26.7% yoy and 6.7% qoq; net margin was 11.3% versus 11.4% in the prior quarter."}